        <h1>Free AI Visibility Audit for Your Business</h1>
        <p class="lead">See exactly how Google, ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity describe, mention and recommend your brand today, compared with your competitors, and what to fix first.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a href="/contact?service=ai-visibility-audit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Get Your Free AI Visibility Audit</a>
          <a href="/solutions" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">See All Solutions</a>
