            <li>ChatGPT</li>
            <li>Google Gemini</li>
            <li>Perplexity</li>
            <li>Microsoft Copilot</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="ai-panel__foot">Benchmarked against your competitors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container prose-block">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Why It Matters</h2></div>
      <p class="text-center reveal" style="font-size:1.1rem;">Your buyers increasingly ask AI assistants which tools and brands to choose before they visit a single website. If those assistants don&rsquo;t mention you, or describe you inaccurately, you can lose the deal before it starts. The audit shows you where you stand.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>What We Review</h2></div>
      <ul class="checklist checklist--2 reveal" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;">
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> How AI assistants answer real buyer questions in your category</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Whether your brand is mentioned, recommended and cited</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> How accurately your products, pricing and positioning are described</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Which competitors and sources the engines prefer</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Your website&rsquo;s technical readiness for search and AI crawlers</li>
        <li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Schema markup and structured data coverage</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
