        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="1"><span class="ai-step__num">2</span><h3>We Run the Analysis</h3><p>We test real buyer questions across search and AI assistants and review your site.</p></li>
        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="2"><span class="ai-step__num">3</span><h3>We Walk You Through It</h3><p>A short call to go through the findings and your action plan. No obligation.</p></li>
